          "title": "You'll want to know: o molhe",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o molhe — \"the breakwater, the pier\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ao fim da tarde, há pescadores no molhe. In the late afternoon, there are fishermen on the breakwater."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A long stone wall that protects a harbour from the waves."
            }
          ]
        },
